WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:07.434
A Bona kɩɩsgã. Yaa marka tẽnga kibar sẽn yɩll n sõng ned t'a bãnge.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.778
Yʋʋmd 1915. Datomon wã meziizã bee Mark tẽnga pʋga.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:23.450
Neb nins sẽn yaa nin-tũusdsã zab n be zĩig zãra. La a sẽn datã yaa woto.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:33.700
D kelg-y! Mesi n na n wa. Neb nins sẽn yaa nin-tũusdsã pãng na n saame.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:45.746
Koe-moond a yembr gomda daar fãa meziizã taoore. Nebã sẽn kelgd-a wã, b tẽedame t'a Zeova na n sõng-b lame.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:55.186
Wakat bʋg la a na n wa? Wilg-y tõnd wakat ninga!

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:15.400
Rẽ poore, b na n yãka neb tɩ b wa tigim taaba. Goosneema wã ratame tɩ b paam sodaas n kẽng zabrã pʋgẽ.

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:17.900
Tõnd kom-bõonegã yaa tõnd pãng pʋʋgẽ wã.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:20.842
B na n loogame. Yaa noor-dãmbã.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:29.450
B gũuda bi-bɩɩsã tɩ b kẽng be. Ma-rãmbã yãbda sorã noore.

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:53.816
Daar a ye yʋngo, kãsem dãmbã tigma taab n gũbg tẽn-kugrã.

00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:57.704
La b zẽka b nus n wẽen ne bãmba.

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:11.040
Zĩigã pʋgẽ, tãmb nins sẽn zabd ne zabrã sɩngame n gomda.

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:25.792
Yʋʋmd 1915, noob kiuug rasem 17 wã, kɩɩsgã yikame.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:36.538
Nebã watame. B sẽn da tar sɩbgrã, b ra yaa tãb-biis n zabd ne-ba.

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:50.696
Neb nins sẽn zabd ne nin-kãsemsã sã n kẽed wallẽ wã, b kolgdame.

00:03:07.000 --> 00:03:11.986
Yaa tẽn-paal sẽn yaa paalga. Bãngr-gomdã bee ne so-pakdb.

00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:24.608
Tʋʋm-kãsems nins b sẽn maan n wilg tɩ b yaa nin-tɩrsã yĩnga, b kɩtame t'a Zeova raabã pidsi.

00:03:37.000 --> 00:03:42.498
La yʋʋmd 1916 wã, b tõdg-a lame. Bãng-y tɩ sã n wa be Bona, bũmb a ye bal n ketẽ.

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:56.128
Tẽngã sã n da pa sak n deeg b sẽn kõ-a wã, a ra baooda ligd wʋsgo.

00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:09.368
Tõnd ba-rãmbã yeelame tɩ pa rẽ ye.

00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:11.796
D pa segd n yĩm-a ye.
